AEGIS release implementation

The adapted SAM/MedSegX backbone in src/aegis/backbones is derived from the
user-provided MedSegX experiment snapshot. Its original sources are:

MedSegX: https://github.com/MedSegX/MedSegX-code
SAM: https://github.com/facebookresearch/segment-anything
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates (SAM files).

Both upstream codebases use Apache License 2.0. Original file notices are retained.
The release modifies import paths, model/checkpoint construction, task validation,
and the training/evaluation interface. New AEGIS loss, data, and runtime modules
implement and document the paper-based cleanup. See docs/METHOD.md for differences.

Model weights and datasets are not included and retain their own source terms.
